{"4298100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Protocol Solari: Escape Room", "steam_appid": 4298100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken alone aboard the <i>Aeterna Solis</i>, a massive colony ship drifting in silence.<br>The crew is gone. The colonists are in cryo sleep. <br>And an autonomous lockdown protocol is in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protocol Solari is a first-person sci-fi escape room experience set aboard a locked-down starship. Restore failing systems, explore interconnected ship areas, and uncover hidden log entries to piece together what happened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/65ebbe7ebafdfca4cd50d112646d8533.poster.avif?t=1784402079\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/65ebbe7ebafdfca4cd50d112646d8533.webm?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/65ebbe7ebafdfca4cd50d112646d8533.mp4?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ship’s systems deteriorate, you’ll solve environmental and logic-based puzzles tied directly to critical operating systems. Every solution brings you closer to the truth… and closer to saving the colonists' lives depending on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/38f6d57c5afd8ca05159ecfa0f7e15fa.poster.avif?t=1784402079\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/38f6d57c5afd8ca05159ecfa0f7e15fa.webm?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/38f6d57c5afd8ca05159ecfa0f7e15fa.mp4?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the Solari Protocol activate?<br>Can you repair the critical systems in time?<br>And why were <i>you</i> the only one left awake?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully immersive first-person escape room set aboard a sci-fi colony ship </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected puzzles based on critical ship systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through hidden logs and terminals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a timer for added pressure or without one for a more casual experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime of around 2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken alone aboard the <i>Aeterna Solis</i>, a massive colony ship drifting in silence.<br>The crew is gone. The colonists are in cryo sleep. <br>And an autonomous lockdown protocol is in control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protocol Solari is a first-person sci-fi escape room experience set aboard a locked-down starship. Restore failing systems, explore interconnected ship areas, and uncover hidden log entries to piece together what happened.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/65ebbe7ebafdfca4cd50d112646d8533.poster.avif?t=1784402079\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/65ebbe7ebafdfca4cd50d112646d8533.webm?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/65ebbe7ebafdfca4cd50d112646d8533.mp4?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ship’s systems deteriorate, you’ll solve environmental and logic-based puzzles tied directly to critical operating systems. Every solution brings you closer to the truth… and closer to saving the colonists' lives depending on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/38f6d57c5afd8ca05159ecfa0f7e15fa.poster.avif?t=1784402079\" width=608 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/38f6d57c5afd8ca05159ecfa0f7e15fa.webm?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4298100/extras/38f6d57c5afd8ca05159ecfa0f7e15fa.mp4?t=1784402079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the Solari Protocol activate?<br>Can you repair the critical systems in time?<br>And why were <i>you</i> the only one left awake?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully immersive first-person escape room set aboard a sci-fi colony ship </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected puzzles based on critical ship systems </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through hidden logs and terminals </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with a timer for added pressure or without one for a more casual experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime of around 2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Awaken alone aboard a drifting colony ship under autonomous lockdown. Restore critical systems, solve inte